This learning project refers to qinguoyi/TinyWebServer:
https://github.com/qinguoyi/TinyWebServer

The user's existing C++17 implementation is retained and extended; the server
source is not a verbatim copy of the upstream server. The project LICENSE
continues to apply to this implementation.

root/xxx.jpg and root/xxx.mp4 are unmodified example assets copied from the
user's local TinyWebServer-master/root distribution for the same demo purpose.
No independent authorship of these assets is claimed. Upstream distribution
and attribution should accompany any reuse of the examples.

test_pressure/webbench-1.5 is a separate tool by Radim Kolar, 1997-2004,
licensed under GPL version 2, not the server's Apache-2.0 license.
Its socket.c includes public-domain code from the Virginia Tech Computing Center.
The original source headers, debian/copyright and COPYING are retained.
Local modifications (2026-10-14): removed the unused rpc/types.h include to build
on current Ubuntu; initialized the signal mask; corrected the parent exit code
to report success/failure instead of the final child's request count. A missing
child result is counted as a failure. The request-generation loop is retained.
